cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "wb-api-repo: World Bank API tooling (Stata + Python)"
abstract: >-
  Dual-stack World Bank Open Data API client combining the Stata wbopendata
  command surface with a modern Python CLI for batch metadata and time-series
  retrieval. Tracks feature parity with the Stata Journal package wbopendata
  (v18.x lineage) while exposing a CLI for non-Stata workflows.
authors:
